  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div>This dataset consists of man-made point features in a transportation network. Transport point features include:</div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>culvert railway symbolized – a enclosed drain under a railway</li>\n<li>culvert roadway symbolized – an enclosed drain under a roadway</li>\n<li>turntable railway – a rotatable platform with a track, used to turn locomotives and cars</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>We are no longer updating this data. It is best suited for historical research and analysis.</div>\n<br />\n\n<div><strong>Additional Documentation</strong></div>\n<div>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Transport Point - Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Transport Point - Documentation (Word)</a><br /></li>\n\t\t<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Transport%20Point%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Transport Point - Data Description (PDF)</a><br /></li>\n\t</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div><strong>Status</strong></div>\n\n<div>Completed: production of the data has been completed</div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong></div>\n\n<div>Not planned: there are no plans to update the data</div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Contact</strong></div>\n\n<div>Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources - Geospatial Ontario, <a href='mailto:geospatial@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>geospatial@ontario.ca </a> </div>"
